Piranhas was added in '''Beta 51.0, '''as a sort of replacement for Beta 34.0 [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Starwalker_Bird Starwalker Bird], both being a 6G 3/3 with Haste and the ability to deal 1 DMG to a random enemy monster whenever it attacked and killed another. The differences are that Piranhas is an Epic rather than a Common and it uses Dodge (2) rather than Ranged (as Ranged was removed). '''Beta 52.0 '''nerfed its HP to 2. This was increased to 4 in '''Beta 53.0''', but it also lost 1 Dodge.

=== Stats ===
ATK: 3

HP:
*3 (Post Beta 51.0)
*2 (Post Beta 52.0)
*4 (Post Beta 53.0, Current)
Cost: 6

Abilities:
* Haste. Dodge (2). Whenever this attacks and kills a monster, deal 1 DMG to a random enemy monster. (Post Beta 51.0)
* Haste. Dodge (1). Whenever this attacks and kills a monster, deal 1 DMG to a random enemy monster. (Post Beta 53.0, Current)

Rarity: Purple (Epic)
